5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,I am a Villager. I will rely on logic to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready to fight! Let's protect our friends together.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! I'm Mio. I hope we have a fun game!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,I observe. Silence is often louder than words. Let's see who blinks.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Minako,,I will maintain order. Please keep your statements concise and factual.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,@Mio Your energy is noted. I prefer data over enthusiasm.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Takumi,,@Asuka Don't be so stiff! We need to trust each other.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mio,,@Takumi I agree! Trust is key. I feel good about this group.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,@Minako You seem in control. Is that a role or just personality?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Minako,,@Shion It is my nature. I will guide the discussion calmly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,@Shion Your question is irrelevant. Focus on identifying threats.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Takumi,,@Shion Just be yourself! We'll figure it out.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mio,,@Asuka Maybe a little less logic and more heart?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,@Asuka Logic is the only reliable tool. Emotions are noise.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Mio Heart is good, but facts are better. Let's stay focused.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. We need to identify the werewolf before nightfall.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"Let's vote wisely tomorrow. I'm with you, Asuka.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Mio,,Okay! I'll listen to everyone. Let's do our best!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shion,,I will wait for the night results. Patience is power.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Minako,,"Good. We will proceed with caution. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
