31,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I have no information yet. I will listen to others' claims.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I feel like someone is hiding something. Who is it?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
